invariant: INV-16
file: src/aead_avx512.c
catches: aead_avx512_equiv_test
reason: a rest of exactly 256 bytes, the most a row pass covers, takes no row
  pass and no last pass, so those 256 bytes stay unencrypted. The
  boundary case: bin/aead_avx512_equiv_test seals 2,304 bytes, two passes
  and 256, over the lane models on every machine.

--- old
        if (index + 1 == passes && rest > 0 && rest <= ROW_PASS_BYTES) {
--- new
        if (index + 1 == passes && rest > 0 && rest < ROW_PASS_BYTES) {
